  "2026-06-25T05:12:23.121Z",codex-ecosystem-auditor,"Evidence: Sentry PM-CLI-1T had one event at 2026-06-25T02:10:19Z and was the only release-gate blocker. After the stats ENOENT race fix, resolved PM-CLI-1T in Sentry and reran node scripts/release/sentry-telemetry-gate.mjs --json --telemetry-mode required: ok=true, sentry critical=0/high=0, telemetry ok=true, finish_error_rate_pct=0.82, failures_without_error_code_rows=0."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
